cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this figure-reproduction package, please cite the archived
  software release and the associated manuscript.
type: software
title: "Figure reproduction code and processed data for heatwave dynamics in storm-resolving ICON simulations"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dolores-Tesillos"
    given-names: "Edgar"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-09
license: MIT
keywords:
  - heatwaves
  - atmospheric blocking
  - convection
  - ICON
  - ERA5
  - climate model evaluation
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Plotting scripts and compact processed NetCDF data used to reproduce five
  main figures from a study of heatwave characteristics and their dynamical
  and land-atmosphere relationships in storm-resolving and parameterized-convection
  ICON simulations relative to ERA5.
